    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44176" root="&#xA;                        نهى&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِهَايَةٌ</span></b> 
                         The <i>utmost possible point,</i> or <i>degree:</i>
(Msb:) and the <i>ultimate point,</i> or <i>element, to
which a thing can be reduced</i> or <i>resolved:</i> its
<i>utmost point</i> or <i>particular:</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْتَهًى</span></b> . See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَصٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نِهَايَةٌ فِى السَّخَآءِ</span> [<i>Extreme in bounty,</i> or
<i>munificence</i>]. (O and K, voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسْحَلٌ</span>.)

